    "en": {
      "trackName": "RainSaved",
      "description": "RainSaved is a calm, haptic-first Apple Watch game about saving rainwater.\n\nRotate the Digital Crown to guide a bucket and catch falling raindrops.\nFeel every splash through gentle haptics.\nWhen the bucket fills, the water is reused — helping something grow.\n\nNo scores.\nNo pressure.\nJust a quiet moment on your wrist.\n\nWhy RainSaved\n-  Designed specifically for Apple Watch\n- Uses the Digital Crown as the main control\n- Haptics bring each drop to life\n- Subtle story about rainwater reuse\n- Perfect for short, glanceable sessions\n\nRainSaved isn’t about winning — it’s about noticing how small actions can add up.\n\nCatch a drop.\nSave it.\nFeel the impact.",
